H("759.d.5.D",4,"The Eighth Amendment prohibits:","cruel and unusual punishment and excessive bail",["free speech","gun ownership","religious worship"],"Eighth = punishment limits.")
H("759.d.5.E",3,"Cases such as Miranda v. Arizona, Weeks v. United States and Gideon v. Wainwright reshaped police and court practice. This analyzes the effect of:","landmark court cases",["recent movies","sports finals","pop songs"],"Landmark decisions set precedent.")
