H("759.d.5.G",3,"A defendant cannot be forced to testify against themself and has the right to a speedy public trial with a lawyer. This explains the impact of the:","Fifth and Sixth Amendments",["First and Third","Seventh and Eighth","Ninth and Tenth"],"Fifth and Sixth protect defendants.")
H("759.d.5.G",4,"The Fifth Amendment protects against:","self-incrimination",["quartering soldiers","unreasonable taxes","censorship"],"No compelled self-incrimination.")

